<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>로그인 - OTT Swipe</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="list-page-container" style="max-width: 400px; margin-top: 100px;">
        <h2 style="text-align: center;">로그인</h2>
        <form action="/login" method="POST" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px;">
            <input type="text" name="username" placeholder="아이디" required style="padding: 10px;">
            <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="비밀번호" required style="padding: 10px;">
            <button type="submit" class="btn" style="background: #e50914; color: white; padding: 10px;">로그인</button>
        </form>
        <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
            계정이 없으신가요? <a href="/register" style="color: #e50914;">회원가입</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>